[4.7.3  Management of Imprest]

The  aggregate  amount  of  outstanding  imprest  decreased  from  the  previous  year's amount of Kshs.128,360.669 to Kshs.38,324,803 in 2019/2020. The decrease points to improvement of controls relating to surrender of imprests. However, it was noted that during  the  year  under  audit,  some  entities  did  not  avail  breakdowns  of  the  reported amounts relating to imprests and advances.

